    <briefdescription>
<para>An abstract base class for specific renderer implementations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classrr_1_1Renderer" kindref="compound">Renderer</ref> interface consists of <ref refid="classrr_1_1Renderer_1a84e149938d154bd8d067b1be2e94a2fb" kindref="member">Renderer::render()</ref> to draw images to the screen and <ref refid="classrr_1_1Renderer_1add7edc93f23223e70b770a36e0e804c4" kindref="member">Renderer::shutdown()</ref> to cleanly exit the <ref refid="classrr_1_1Renderer" kindref="compound">Renderer</ref> early</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Felix Hommel </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>7/18/2025 </para>
